OL,3,GNEWSAOperator sought for town's food
OL,4,Aand drink hub
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn operator is being sought to take
OL,7,Fcharge of a redesigned food and drinks
OL,8,Fhub in Melton Mowbray.
OL,10,FThe town's borough council said on
OL,11,FTuesday it was accepting proposals for
OL,12,Fan events and markets operator to run
OL,13,Fthe Stockyard ` located in the town's
OL,14,Flivestock market ` from June 2027.
OL,16,FOfficials said they wanted to find an
OL,17,Foperator that could "unlock the full
OL,18,Fpotential of the redeveloped site and
OL,19,Fbuild a vibrant year-round programme
OL,20,Ffor the town".
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
